{
    "eo": {
        "Goku": "Goku",
        "And so he left, hungry for more.": "Kaj tiel li foriris, malsata je pli.",
        "Default": "Defauxlta",
        "Goku Black": "Goku Black",
        "Drip": "Drip",
        "Saiyan Blood": "Sango de Saiyan",
        "Skills also require <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> to be used!\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Main Transformation</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (View Transformations Tab for more info).\nPerform a <color=#FF5400>Kaioken Transformation</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>C</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Power down</color> by tapping <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Fly</color> by holding <color=#03f4fc>Jump</color>.": "Kapabloj ankaux postulas <color=#03bcff>Ki</color> por esti uzataj!\nPlenumu <color=#FF5400>Cxefan Transformigxon</color> premante <color=#03f4fc>C</color> (Vidu la langeton pri Transformigxoj por pliaj informoj).\nPlenumu <color=#FF5400>Kaioken-Transformigxon</color> tenante <color=#03f4fc>C</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Malaktivigu formon</color> premante <color=#03f4fc>X</color>.\n<color=#FF5400>Flugu</color> tenante <color=#03f4fc>Salti</color>.",
        "Melee Strike": "Korpobata Frapo",
        "Deal <color=#E5C962>280% Damage</color> each strike!\nGain <color=#03bcff>9% Ki</color> Per Hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auto-moves to targeted enemies.</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>Teleports instead if </color><color=#FF5400>Kaioken</color><color=#03f4fc> is active!</color>": "Kauxzas <color=#E5C962>280% da Damagxo</color> je cxiu bato!\nRicevu <color=#03bcff>9% da Ki</color> por trafo!\n<color=#03f4fc>Auxtomate movigxas al celataj malamikoj.</color>\n<color=#03f4fc>Teleportigxas anstatauxe se </color><color=#FF5400>Kaioken</color><color=#03f4fc> estas aktiva!</color>",
        "Triple Kick (Legacy)": "Triobla Piedbato (Heredajxo)",
        "Unleashes a trio of kicks! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>260% Damage</color> each!\nGain <color=#03bcff>5% Ki</color> Per Hit!": "Eligxas triopo de piedbatoj!\nKauxzante <color=#E5C962>260% da Damagxo</color> cxiu!\nRicevu <color=#03bcff>5% da Ki</color> por trafo!",
        "Ki Blast": "Ki-Eksplodo",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>6 Ki</color>\nFire off a speedy Ki Blast! \n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill fires an additional blast </color>\nDealing <color=#E5C962>350% Damage</color> for each one!\n": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>6 Ki</color>\nPafu rapidan Ki-Eksplodon!\n<color=#03f4fc>Teni cxi tiun kapablon pafas plian eksplodon </color>\nKauxzante <color=#E5C962>350% da Damagxo</color> por cxiu!\n",
        "Meteor Crash": "Meteora Kolizio",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nRapidly unleash a barrage of strikes! \nDealing <color=#E5C962>340% Damage</color> for each one!\n<color=#03f4fc>Holding this skill drains </color><color=#03bcff>10% Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>per second.</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>20 Ki</color>\nRapide elsendu seriegon de batoj!\nKauxzante <color=#E5C962>340% da Damagxo</color> por cxiu!\n<color=#03f4fc>Teni cxi tiun kapablon drenas </color><color=#03bcff>10% da Ki </color><color=#03f4fc>sekunde.</color>",
        "Instant Transmission": "Tuja Translokigo",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>25 Ki</color>\nFocus on your target and teleport!\n<color=#03f4fc>Distance is limited if there is no target</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>25 Ki</color>\nFokusigxu sur via celo kaj teleportigxu!\n<color=#03f4fc>Distanco estas limigita se ne estas celo</color>",
        "Ki Charge": "Ki-Sxargxo",
        "Hold and Regenerate <color=#03bcff>20% Ki</color> Per Second\n<color=#03f4fc>Mitigates strain, allowing for extended Kaioken usage.</color>": "Tenu kaj Regeneru <color=#03bcff>20% da Ki</color> Sekunde\n<color=#03f4fc>Mildigas strecxon, ebligante plilongigitan uzon de Kaioken.</color>",
        "Kamehameha": "Kamehameha",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>30 Ki</color>\nSxargu kaj elsendu Kamehameha, Kauxzante <color=#E5C962>1200% da Damagxo</color> sekunde dum la eksplodo estas aktiva!\nKonsumu plian Ki kaj pliigu damagxon je <color=#E5C962>1000% da Damagxo</color> por sekundo de sxargado!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki-konsumo iom post iom pligrandigxas ju pli longe vi sxargas!</color>",
        "Spirit Bomb": "Genkidama",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a Spirit Bomb, Dealing <color=#E5C962>400% Damage</color> per 0.3 seconds to enemies within it! \nConsume additional Ki and increase overall damage by <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>\n\n<color=#03f4fc>If the Spirit Bomb collides with a boss or the ground, it will explode, Dealing </color><color=#E5C962>4000% Damage</color>\n<color=#999999>Gain Bonus Armor whilst standing still.</color>\n<color=#FF0000>Whilst moving the Spirit Bomb will not charge!</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>200 Ki</color>\nSxargu kaj elsendu Genkidama, Kauxzante <color=#E5C962>400% da Damagxo</color> cxiu 0.3 sekundoj al malamikoj interne de gxi!\nKonsumu plian Ki kaj pliigu gxeneralan damagxon je <color=#E5C962>1200% da Damagxo</color> por sekundo de sxargado!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki-konsumo iom post iom pligrandigxas ju pli longe vi sxargas!</color>\n\n<color=#03f4fc>Se la Genkidama kolizias kun estro aux la tero, gxi eksplodos, Kauxzante </color><color=#E5C962>4000% da Damagxo</color>\n<color=#999999>Gajnu Bonusan Kirason dum vi staras senmove.</color>\n<color=#FF0000>Dum movigxado la Genkidama ne sxargigxos!</color>",
        "Angry Kamehameha": "Kolera Kamehameha",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nUnleash an Angry Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1550% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active!": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nElsendu Koleran Kamehameha, Kauxzante <color=#E5C962>1550% da Damagxo</color> sekunde dum la eksplodo estas aktiva!",
        "Ki Blast Barrage": "Salvo de Ki-Eksplodoj",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color>\nUnleash an Barrage of Ki Blasts, Dealing <color=#E5C962>205% Damage</color> with each one!": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>80 Ki</color>\nElsendu Salvon de Ki-Eksplodoj, Kauxzante <color=#E5C962>205% da Damagxo</color> per cxiu!",
        "Dragon Fist": "Draka Pugno",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>225 Ki</color>\nCharge forward and unleash a Fiery Dragon Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>2400% Damage</color> to every enemy hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Deals bonus damage to low health targets!</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>225 Ki</color>\nSxargu antauxen kaj elsendu Fajran Drakan Pugnon, Kauxzante <color=#E5C962>2400% da Damagxo</color> al cxiu trafita malamiko!\n<color=#03f4fc>Kauxzas bonusan damagxon al malalt-sanaj celoj!</color>",
        "God Bind": "Dia Ligilo",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>150 Ki</color>\nChannel the Saiyan God's power and deal <color=#E5C962>800% Damage</color> and stun per pulse!\n<color=#03f4fc>Extend the duration at the cost of </color><color=#03bcff>10 Ki per second!</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>150 Ki</color>\nKanalizu la potencon de la Saiyan-Dio kaj kauxzu <color=#E5C962>800% da Damagxo</color> kaj svenon por pulso!\n<color=#03f4fc>Plilongigu la dauxron kontraux kosto de </color><color=#03bcff>10 Ki sekunde!</color>",
        "God Fist Kamehameha": "Dia Pugno Kamehameha",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nCharge and Unleash a God Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>4000% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nThen continuing with a God Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1200% Damage</color> to each enemy hit!": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>300 Ki</color>\nSxargu kaj Elsendu Dian Kamehameha, Kauxzante <color=#E5C962>4000% da Damagxo</color> sekunde dum la eksplodo estas aktiva!\nPoste dauxrigante per Dia Pugno, Kauxzante <color=#E5C962>1200% da Damagxo</color> al cxiu trafita malamiko!",
        "Godly Display": "Dia Montro",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>400 Ki</color>\nrapidly teleport and strike all nearby enemies dealing <color=#E5C962>600% Damage</color>!\nFinishes off with a powerful roar dealing <color=#E5C962>2000% Damage</color> to all nearby enemies!\n<color=#03f4fc>The number of strikes increases based on attack speed</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>400 Ki</color>\nRapide teleportigxu kaj frapu cxiujn proksimajn malamikojn kauxzante <color=#E5C962>600% da Damagxo</color>!\nFinas per potenca blekego kauxzante <color=#E5C962>2000% da Damagxo</color> al cxiuj proksimaj malamikoj!\n<color=#03f4fc>La nombro da frapoj pligrandigxas surbaze de atakrapideco</color>",
        "Kamehameha x10": "Kamehameha x10",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a powerful Kamehameha x10, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1300% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1400% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>60 Ki</color>\nSxargu kaj elsendu potencan Kamehameha x10, Kauxzante <color=#E5C962>1300% da Damagxo</color> sekunde dum la eksplodo estas aktiva!\nKonsumu plian Ki kaj pliigu damagxon je <color=#E5C962>1400% da Damagxo</color> por sekundo de sxargado!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki-konsumo iom post iom pligrandigxas ju pli longe vi sxargas!</color>",
        "Black Kamehameha": "Nigra Kamehameha",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>70 Ki</color>\nCharge and unleash a godly Black Kamehameha, Dealing <color=#E5C962>1700% Damage</color> per second whilst the blast is active! \nConsume additional Ki and increase damage by <color=#E5C962>1000% Damage</color> per second of charging!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki consumption gradually increases the longer you charge!</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>70 Ki</color>\nSxargu kaj elsendu dian Nigran Kamehameha, Kauxzante <color=#E5C962>1700% da Damagxo</color> sekunde dum la eksplodo estas aktiva!\nKonsumu plian Ki kaj pliigu damagxon je <color=#E5C962>1000% da Damagxo</color> por sekundo de sxargado!\n<color=#03f4fc>Ki-konsumo iom post iom pligrandigxas ju pli longe vi sxargas!</color>",
        "White Dragon Fist": "Blanka Draka Pugno",
        "Costs <color=#03bcff>350 Ki</color>\nCharge forward and unleash a Fiery Dragon Fist, Dealing <color=#E5C962>4200% Damage</color> to every enemy hit!\n<color=#03f4fc>Deals bonus damage to low health targets!</color>": "Kostas <color=#03bcff>350 Ki</color>\nSxargu antauxen kaj elsendu Fajran Drakan Pugnon, Kauxzante <color=#E5C962>4200% da Damagxo</color> al cxiu trafita malamiko!\n<color=#03f4fc>Kauxzas bonusan damagxon al malalt-sanaj celoj!</color>",
        "DuoFinalKamehamehaSkill": "Duopa Fina Kamehameha",
